    {
      "id": "2120636359279104445",
      "text": "Saints RB CJ Donaldson also did not participate in practice Wednesday. And DT Christen Miller had a knee issue pop up that made him a limited participant. Alvin Kamara is listed as back/rest, and Kellen Moore said it’s trending toward a weekly rest day for him. https://t.co/oj7y9N47sB",
