    {
      "id": "2120634777602842684",
      "text": "Kellen Moore said the Saints will decide at the end of the week if Travis Etienne is ready to play in his first week back: \"We’ll see. There’s some potential for it. But ... we'll just let the week kind of play out and see what it looks like.\"",
      "url": "https://x.com/MikeTriplett/status/2120634777602842684",
      "published": "2026-11-11T21:48:25+00:00",
      "likes": 115,
      "author": "Mike Triplett",
      "handle": "MikeTriplett",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1784735807070199808/GWgEUOFm_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Travis Etienne returned to practice for the Saints on Wednesday. He’s been on IR since Week 3 with a hamstring injury Erik McCoy (biceps) and Alvin Kamara were the only ones we didn’t see participating in portion of practice open to media https://t.co/1ZUPw5NSxq via @NofNetwork",
      "quoted_author": "Mike Triplett",
      "quoted_handle": "MikeTriplett"
    },
    {
      "id": "2120634749203153152",
      "text": "This means a few things - Saints can get more starting reps for Jeremiah Wright at right guard - Saints can keep utilizing Will Sherman as a jumbo tight end … had some good success with that last week",
      "url": "https://x.com/Jeff_Nowak/status/2120634749203153152",
      "published": "2026-11-11T21:48:18+00:00",
      "likes": 165,
      "author": "Jeff Nowak",
      "handle": "Jeff_Nowak",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2089567434491703296/HvgeZn2f_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Kellen Moore said Cesar Ruiz will start at center against the Panthers. #Saints",
      "quoted_author": "Jeff Nowak",
      "quoted_handle": "Jeff_Nowak"
    },
